      "filePath": "src/engines/SessionCore/sync/brick/brickHistoryClient.ts",
      "summary": "Typed Stage-1 shadow-read adapter over the `brick history` CLI surface from the ORGII Adapter Contract; runs the brick binary via an injected command runner, validates JSON responses into versioned DTOs, and gates on the binary's reported contract version.",
      "tags": ["adapter", "cli-client", "validation", "service"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Uses an injected BrickCommandRunner function type so production can wire the Tauri shell plugin while tests supply a stub, keeping the adapter free of direct process-spawning concerns."
    },
