      "filePath": "src/engines/SessionCore/sync/brick/tauriBrickRunner.ts",
      "summary": "Production BrickCommandRunner implementation backed by the Tauri shell plugin, executing the brick binary via `sh -c 'exec \"$0\" \"$@\"'` with array arguments to avoid shell injection.",
      "tags": ["tauri", "shell-integration", "adapter", "process-execution"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Uses `exec` inside an `sh -c` wrapper so positional args are never shell-interpolated and the child process exit code propagates directly, satisfying the adapter contract's injection-safety requirement."
